  "What is this?": "",
  "Neither one will do": "",
  "I'll try my best": "",
  "I'm a little scared": "",
  "<size=26>I was making soup at home</size>": "",
  "<size=26>{{A}} shared a few more small invention ideas, I was sweating profusely when I heard them...</size>": "",
  "I look forward to hearing more stories about the Great Inventor {{A}} in the future...": "",
  "The Legendary Fish Whisperer": "",
  "Have you heard about the Fish Whisperer at Ichigaya Fishing Pond?": "",
  "What's that? Some weird old guy who talks to fish?": "",
  "No, it's actually a young guy! He's a regular there, and apparently some kind of master fisherman.": "",
  "He says the fish come right to him. I heard that one time he caught a huge sucker without even using a hook...!": "",
  "No way that's real. It's probably just some rumor spun out of control.": "",
  "Yeah, spun like his fishing reel! Hahaha!": "",
  "He's probably there right now. Should we go see?": "",
  "Hey, we're still on the clock here! Come on, let's get back to work.": "",
  "Hoom... A fish whisperer? Intriguing. I think this rumor warrants checking out, don't you agree?": "",
  "I went to the fishing pond to look for the Fish Whisperer...": "",
  "Fish Whisperer": "",
  "Welcome, welcome. Ah, you're lookin' for the Fish Whisperer?": "",
  "He's here all right! It's the long-haired guy sittin' just over there.": "",
  "Let's see if the rumors are true...": "",
  "The Fish Whisperer is baiting his hook. I wonder if there's some special trick to it...": "",
  "Ngh... This bait just won't stay on...": "",
  "Look at the surface of the water...!": "",
  "Without even doing anything, the fish are gathering around him...!": "",
  "So impatient! Haha, I haven't even cast my line yet.": "",
  "It's as if the fish want to be caught by him.": "",
  "Maybe he has influence on other beings' desires as well... Shall we continue observing him for a while?": "",
  "All right, come and get it.": "",
  "Oh, here we go.": "",
  "He caught two fish on one hook!?": "",
  "Haha, off to a good start.": "",
  "This isn't just skill...": "",
  "Oh, hello. Did you need something?": "",
  "Please be my mentor": "",
  "<size=29>I want to be your student</size>": "",
  "So now I'm a Fishermentor? Haha! Nobody's ever asked me to teach them before.": "",
  "Hmmm, I'd really like to say yes...": "",
  "Well, take a seat. You'll get tired standing up for so long. Plus, it'll scare the fish.": "",
  "The secret to fishing? \\nI don't really know, to be honest.": "",
  "I used to come here when I was feeling blocked. I'd clear my head, toss a line in the water, and then...": "",
  "Fish started chomping right away. \\nThe rest is history.": "",
  "I always wondered why, and I honestly still don't know.": "",
  "So even if you become my student, there's not much I can teach you.": "",
  "If you're okay with that, then... sure.": "",
  "I became a student of the Fish Whisperer...": "",
  "Thanks!": "",
  "Looking forward to it!": "",
  "Oh right. If I'm going to be your mentor, I should introduce myself.": "",
  "I'm {{A}}. I'm pretty much here every day, but if not, I'm probably in Shinjuku?": "",
  "I introduced myself...": "",
  "$1-kun, huh? Nice name. \\nWell, let's get fishing.": "",
  "Doing nothing is important when you're fishing. The same goes for life.": "",
  "Work, school, romance... everything. You'll wear yourself out if you're just plowing ahead all the time.": "",
  "I guess he has a point...": "",
  "You just need enough money to get by. \\nNo need to push yourself too hard at work.": "",
  "Whenever my bank account reaches zero, that's when I find work.": "",
  "I'm having second thoughts about the quality of my education...": "",
  "Look, you got one.": "",
  "I've never caught a fish this big...!": "",
  "Well, look at that. \\nSomeone's got a knack for this!": "",
  "Thanks to you": "",
  "Not really...": "",
  "Teach a man to fish": "",
  "No, no. It was 100% you. I'm sure of it.": "",
  "Come on, no need to be humble.": "",
  "Someone's well read! But really, you might be a better fisherman than me.": "",
  "I mean, that advice I just gave you? \\nI just made that up off the top of my head.": "",
  "And then you went and caught a huge fish. \\nYou're amazing!": "",
  "He seems to be laid-back to a fault...": "",
  "Ah, sorry! Did that sound sarcastic? \\nI didn't mean it to.": "",
  "You came all the way here, so I just didn't want you to leave feeling bad.": "",
  "It's nice if you catch something, but fishing is still fun even if you don't. It's a nice way to spend time.": "",
  "And the things I'm teaching you aren't completely random, just so you know.": "",
  "Still, the fact that you improved so much from my abstract advice is pretty darn impressive.": "",
  "Hm. Maybe I should get a little more serious with my advice then.": "",
  "Cherish your friends!": "",
  "Find someone who'll pay for your meals!": "",
  "Never refuse a gift!": "",
  "And one more thing... Hmm... \\nI forgot. I'll tell you later.": "",
  "He's a genius when it comes to fishing, but maybe that's the extent of it...": "",
  "{{A}}! \\nThanks for your help the other day.": "",
  "Misaki-chan? Is it safe for you to be out and about right now?": "",
  "Misaki": "",
  "I'll be fine if it's just for a second!\\nThere's no way he knows I'm here.": "",
  "You should be more careful. \\nHe's really pushy, isn't he?": "",
  "I mean, yeah... He showed up at my job and threw a fit right there in the store.": "",
  "Who's pushy": "",
  "<size=28>He threw a fit at your job?</size>": "",
  "Some guy who works as a host has been trying to get more and more money out of her, to the point that he's threatening violence.": "",
  "{{A}} found a place that would shelter me, so I'm hiding out there now.": "",
  "Shouldn't you be getting back there? \\nThey'll worry about you.": "",
  "I know. Well, see you later!": "",
  "One day Misaki-chan was here at the fishing pond crying. I asked her was wrong and she told me about that guy.": "",
  "Hearing that, who wouldn't try to help?": "",
  "{{A}} seems like a considerate guy who looks out for people...": "",
  "What's wrong, Ueda-san? You look beat.": "",
  "Ueda": "",
  "Remember how we talked about my confectionery shop?": "",
  "Of course. That dango you gave me before was really good.": "",
  "Haha, thanks.": "",
  "Well, I made a terrible mistake today.": "",
  "What kind of mistake?": "",
  "I took an order for 100 manju, but somehow I thought they said 1000.": "",
  "It said 100 right there on the order form, \\nso I don't know how I messed it up...": "",
  "We managed to make all 1000 manju, but when I went to deliver them, I realized my mistake.": "",
  "So now I have 900 left over... \\nWhat should I do?": "",
  "That's a pretty big problem. \\nIf only there was something I could do...": "",
  "I think 900 manju is way too many for me to finish...": "",
  "There must be some way to solve this.": "",
  "No, it's okay! It's my mistake after all...": "",
  "I just felt like I needed to talk about it, \\nso naturally I came to you.": "",
  "Hey, $1-kun. \\nGot any idea what to do about this?": "",
  "Post about it online": "",
  "Use social media": "",
  "Ah... so we should get people online to help him out? Not a bad idea!": "",
  "Ueda-san, could you tell me the name and location of your shop?": "",
  "I think I can help.": "",
  "Thanks. The shop's name is...": "",
  "Okay... I wrote the shop name, location, and explained the situation. Let's hope this works...": "",
  "{{A}} posted about the manju on social media...": "",
  "Talking to you really calmed me down, {{A}}-kun. I'm gonna head back to work and apologize to everyone.": "",
  "Bye. Oh, and thanks for your help too, kid.": "",
  "I hope things turn out okay for him...": "",
  "{{A}} may be a slacker, but\\njust like fish, people seem drawn to him...": "",
  "Thanks, by the way. That was a good idea. \\nSo, should we get back to fishing?": "",
  "I enjoyed fishing with {{A}}...": "",
  "Go fishing": "",
  "Hey, $1-kun. I was just headed to the fishing pond. Wanna come along?": "",
  "Would you like to spend time with {{A}}?": "",
  "No worries, maybe next time.": "",
  "You're doing well.": "",
  "{{A}}-kun! Thanks so much for your help the other day. We sold all of our manju thanks to you!": "",
  "Glad to hear it! \\nI was worried for a while there.": "",
  "All 900 of them!?": "",
  "<size=28>But there were so many...</size>": "",
  "People saw your post and started lining up outside the shop! You really saved my skin!": "",
  "And now our manju's more popular than ever! We're selling it daily.": "",
  "Here. I brought this as a thank you. \\nThe notorious manju itself.": "",
  "Wow, thanks!": "",
  "I should get back to my deliveries. I've gotten real busy thanks to you, {{A}}-kun! See you around!": "",
  "Heh, if I get a free manju out of it, I'll promote the place as much as he wants!": "",
  "One post from {{A}} and customers come flooding in...? Just who is this guy...?": "",
  "By the way, $1-kun. About the guy sitting next to you...": "",
  "He looks kind of down. \\nI'm a little worried.": "",
  "But if a deadbeat like me tried to ask him what's the matter, he'd probably get freaked out.": "",
  "Leave it to me": "",
  "I'll talk to him": "",
  "You're a lifesaver, $1-kun. \\nSuch a good guy. I'm counting on you.": "",
  "<size=26>You look like you had a rough day</size>": "",
  "<size=30>You look a bit down...</size>": "",
  "Me? Crap, is it that obvious?": "",
  "I came here to try and get out of my head, but I guess it's not working.": "",
  "Wanna talk about it?": "",
  "...You're a strange dude. We only just met, but I kinda feel like I could talk to you.": "",
  "Great! Since you happened to sit here with us, I want you to have fun fishing.": "",
  "Uh... Who's this guy?": "",
  "You want me to have fun? \\nDo you work here or something?": "",
  "Nope. Just a customer. \\nI come here every day though.": "",
  "How does a grown adult go to the fishing pond every day...?": "",
  "What about your job?": "",
  "My job? Now that's a good question, haha.": "",
  "You know this guy...?": "",
  "Is there something wrong with him?": "",
  "He seems pretty suspicious of {{A}}...": "",
  "Honestly, I am pretty useless for an adult.": "",
  "He's a little worrying": "",
  "He's my mentor!": "",
  "Really?": "",
  "Are you sure?": "",
  "You're too kind, $1-kun.": "",
  "And you're taking advantage of that kindness, no doubt...": "",
  "Oh, I'm just teaching him how to fish.": "",
  "Oh, really?": "",
  "I guess I need to do a better job at earning your trust.": "",
  "How about you quit coming here and try getting a job...": "",
  "That won't do. Who's going to teach $1-kun here how to fish?": "",
  "Mentor? In what...?": "",
  "Well, this is a fishing pond, so fishing, of course! I happen to be pretty good at it.": "",
  "$1-kun and I always have fun fishing here.": "",
  "That's why I got concerned when I saw the sad look on your face.": "",
  "Actually, I did come here to try and turn my mood around.": "",
  "Would you hear me out...?": "",
  "Of course I will!": "",
  "I wasn't talking to you...": "",
  "Fine, fine, just keep talking.": "",
  "So, I'm in the fencing club at school. I practice every single day...": "",
  "But our advisor and the other club members keep saying I train too much.": "",
  "Maybe I do push myself a little, but to me it seems like everyone else is slacking off.": "",
  "Who are those couch potatoes to tell me to relax...?": "",
  "I see... Sounds like you're a very serious, hard worker.": "",
  "No, I'm... normal.": "",
  "Working hard without seeing it as such is quite the character trait.": "",
  "{{A}} is making an unusual amount of sense...": "",
  "Uh, thanks...": "",
  "But since you don't see it that way, you might be overworking yourself without realizing it.": "",
  "That's why your advisor and friends are worried. Maybe you should relax a little.": "",
  "No way I'm gonna listen to a grown-up that does nothing but fish all day.": "",
  "<size=26>I agree with {{A}}</size>": "",
  "<size=28>You should take it a bit easier</size>": "",
  "Oh... Well, if you think so too, then maybe this weirdo's actually on to something.": "",
  "Haha, you're one tough nut. This might be the first time someone's found my advice fishy.": "",
  "Maybe you've just been giving advice to a bunch of simpletons.": "",
  "Come on, now": "",
  "I know it's not smart to ignore people's opinions completely. That's why I'm here trying to break up my routine.": "",
  "There's this author I really respect, and he always talks about the importance of clearing your head.": "",
  "He also says that going to a fishing pond is great for that kind of thing. That's why I decided to come here.": "",
  "Huh. Sounds like an interesting person.": "",
  "He is. Maybe you should try cracking a book instead of hanging around here all day.": "",
  "Can't argue with that. I've been fishing all the time lately. Maybe I will read something.": "",
  "The three of us enjoyed chatting and fishing together...": "",
  "Thanks a lot for today. \\nI think fishing did help me feel better.": "",
  "It definitely turned my mood around. \\nI think I'll come back again.": "",
  "Oh, please do.": "",
  "I'll aim for a time when you're not here.": "",
  "That'll never work, haha. \\nI'm here every day.": "",
  "Huh... I see...": "",
  "Oh, right! Would you mind telling me your name? Now that we've gotten to know each other and all.": "",
  "I'm $1. And this is $2-kun.": "",
  "I already know his name. You've been calling him that the whole time.": "",
  "I'm {{A}}. \\nThank you for today.": "",
  "I'm gonna stop by my club and practice for a bit.": "",
  "See you around.": "",
  "Hahaha. {{A}}-kun really didn't take kindly to me, did he? Well, who could blame him?": "",
  "But thanks to you, we became friends. Much appreciated, $1-kun.": "",
  "Let's fish a bit more and then get going.": "",
  "I enjoyed fishing while listening to {{A}}'s advice...": "",
  "Quit messing with me! I know this is all your doing!": "",
  "What are you doing": "",
  "He doesn't even work, but everyone loves him. My customers won't shut up about him.": "",
  "Love and Bonjiri": "",
  "A new order just came in, and the customer ordered bonjiri.": "",
  "Bonjiri?": "",
  "Bonjiri is made from tailbone meat at the end of a chicken's rump.": "",
  "Uh, the guest left a note saying: \"Call me downstairs when you arrive\".": "",
  "That's odd. maybe they don't want to be disturbed? Be careful when delivering the food.": "",
  "The food is ready for delivery. Take it and go.": "",
  "Do I go upstairs?": "",
  "Yes, I'm downstairs.": "",
  "Please don't come upstairs. I'll go downstairs and get the food.": "",
  "Oh, nothing... Someone got the wrong number.": "",
  "Okabe, I'm suddenly feeling a little stuffy. I'm gonna go for a walk.": "",
  "Alright, don't come home late. I've got a healthy diet meal for you again today.": "",
  "You walk into the bar": "",
  "My boyfriend... he doesn't like that I eat bonjiri.": "",
  "What the hell is that?\\nIs that bonjiri?!": "",
  "First you ate at that place in Zoshigaya without me knowing, and now you're ordering delivery.": "",
  "It's not like you don't know what bonjiri is.": "",
  "You're always drinking, and that's really bad for your liver, too.": "",
  "Do you really need to eat a fat, greasy bonjiri?": "",
  "I don't want to kiss lips that have eaten bonjiri.": "",
  "Hmm? Our costumer's boyfriend doesn't like bonjiri...": "",
  "I'm sure it's not because bonjiri tastes bad.": "",
  "I'll pass.": "",
  "Hello. I'm Ren Ito, and I'm the one who just returned the delivery.": "",
  "Um... I see no signs of it being opened, so I'll refund your money.": "",
  "Sir, I'm not here for a refund.": "",
  "He might be the reason I'll never eat bonjiri again.": "",
  "Sir, give me 10 skewers of bonjiri!": "",
  "Oh, I love your passionate love for bonjiri! But if you eat 10 of them in one go, you'll probably get sick.": "",
  "But, why are you guys fighting over eating bonjiri?": "",
  "I don't think so.": "",
  "Ito-san, do you love your boyfriend?": "",
  "Yes... I do.": "",
  "You like bonjiri, right?": "",
  "Think about it. What's more important, <color=#ff0000>Your boyfriend</color> or <color=#ff0000>your favourite food, bonjiri</color>?": "",
  "The bonjiri": "",
  "The boyfriend": "",
  "As a yakitori chef, I'd be happy, but your boyfriend will be sad.": "",
  "Ito-san, bonjiri is not as important as someone you love the most.": "",
  "Yeah... if I change my diet, I can give up bonjiri.": "",
  "I could feel Ito-san's love for food, and she is a very special guest.": "",
  "There you are. Yesterday, we had a customer who wanted to know how bonjiri was made.": "",
  "a Customer?": "",
  "Wanted to know about bonjiri?": "",
  "Yes, he had never eaten bonjiri, but he was very interested in the ingredients and the recipe.": "",
  "I showed the complete recipe for bonjiri in front of him.": "",
  "Bonjiri is naturally fatty, so it doesn't need much oiling.": "",
  "So did he eat it?": "",
  "I'll say it word for word: \"I've never eaten anything more delicious in my life!\"": "",
  "It turned out to be Okabe-san, Ito-san's boyfriend.": "",
  "He wanted to know what mysterious magic could have fascinated Ito-san so much.": "",
  "Hmm? We have a new order for the Bonjiri Luxury Couples Set.": "",
  "Ito-san is the one who placed the order.": "",
  "Could you hold on while I get it ready? I know it's a lot of work, but I'm going to need you to help me deliver it.": "",
  "It's finally here, the Bonjour Couple Luxury Set!": "",
  "Ever since I had a taste of bonjiri, I've been thinking about it.": "",
  "Mmmm... it smells delicious! The crust is amazing!": "",
  "Okabe, I think you like bonjiri more than I do.": "",
  "No, I like bonjiri, but I like you more.": "",
  "I've already seen the reviews your customers have left!": "",
  "5 stars! \"Bonjiri made our love deeper!\"": "",
  "There are definitely some love stories that involve food.": "",
  "And to think that one of them is because of my bonjiri...": "",
  "It sounds like they both learned a thing or two about the true meaning of love through bonjiri.": "",
  "What about Chata?": "",
  "Find Chata in Shinjuku.": "",
  "Anyways, I can't leave now.": "",
  "I'll get right into it.": "",
  "Chata is in <color=#ff0000>Shinjuku</color>.": "",
  "Head to Shinjuku and find Chata.": "",
  "How am I supposed talk to him...": "",
  "Hmm... Is this what you humans call \"subtlety\"?": "",
  "Help me, Ruferu.": "",
  "I'm next to him.": "",
  "There are <color=#ff0000>7</color> treasure spots in Shinjuku.": "",
  "I'll leave the rest to you.": "",
  "I'm sure Chata is happy to have someone like you helping him out.": "",
  "It's not urgent.": "",
  "Aren't you in a hurry?": "",
  "Hahahaha, Kurri says it's time for you to go.": "",
  "You're to meet Kuri while searching for treasure.": "",
